    (:math:`l \ge 2`) is the hidden state :math:`h^{(l-1)}_t` of the previous layer multiplied by
    dropout :math:`\delta^{(l-1)}_t` where each :math:`\delta^{(l-1)}_t` is a Bernoulli random
