            Only present when ``bidirectional=True``.
        bias_ih_l[k]_reverse:  Analogous to `bias_ih_l[k]` for the reverse direction.
            Only present when ``bidirectional=True``.
        bias_hh_l[k]_reverse:  Analogous to `bias_hh_l[k]` for the reverse direction.
